              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya mwanace jwa Yehoyada ŵakutyocela ku Kabisele ŵaliji mundu jwakulimba mtima; ŵatesile yejinji yakusimonjesya pakwawulaga acakulungwa ŵaŵili ŵa ngondo ŵa cilambo ca Mowabu. Lyuŵa line kusa kuli mkusisima ŵajinjile mwisimbo mwele muwawuleje lisimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵawuleje soni mundu jwine jwa ku Iguputo jwamkulungwa cilu, nipo ulewu wakwe waliji kupunda mamita gaŵili ni hafu. Mundujo ŵakwete lipanga m'myala mwakwe. Benaya ŵapite kwa mundujo ali ajigele mpici nipo ŵasumwile lipanga kutyocela m'myala mwa mundu jwa ku Iguputojo, nipo ŵamwuleje ni lipanga lyakwe lilyolyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeleyi ni yiŵatesile Benaya mwanace jwa Yehoyada nipo ŵapikanice mpela acimlongola ŵane makumi gatatu ŵala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya ŵaliji ŵakupikanika sikati ja ŵa ngondo makumi gatatu ŵala nambope nganapayika pa asilikali ŵatatu ŵala. Daudi ŵamŵisile Benaya kuŵa jwakulamulila asilikali ŵakwalondela Mwenye Daudiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
